    "body": "Seems like the build is failing due to some webdriver-bidi export ambiguity around `events`, though I'm not sure why it didn't fail before 🤔 ... looks similar to these recent issues (https://github.com/w3c/webdriver-bidi/pull/348, https://github.com/w3c/webdriver-bidi/pull/349). Should I just do some `link-defaults` stuff in the current PR, or would it be better to get webdriver-bidi fixed?\r\n\r\n*edited*, aha, I see @annevk is [already on it](https://github.com/w3c/webdriver-bidi/issues/358)",
